drogon: Drogon is a C++14/17/20-based HTTP application framework. It uses an
drogon: event loop and a thread pool, non-blocking I/O, to handle requests,
drogon: and is one of the fastest C++ web frameworks on the TechEmpower
drogon: benchmarks. It provides routing, filters, view templates, an ORM
drogon: (PostgreSQL/MySQL/SQLite3), WebSocket, HTTP/1.x and HTTP/2, and a
drogon: code generator (drogon_ctl) for scaffolding views and models.
